{
  "repo": "URTC-TESTER",
  "ecosystem": "urtc",
  "tagline": "A live CAN exerciser: it asks the board which tool it is, shows that tool's controls and telemetry, and transmits only when armed.",
  "description": "URTC-TESTER connects to a URTC board through a USB-CAN adapter (SLCAN or SocketCAN), reads which of the 25 tool profiles the board is jumpered for and shows the controls and the telemetry of that tool in a Qt Quick window. It starts in listen-only mode, never touches flash and can also run without a window from test plans. Everything is tested against simulated boards; nothing has been run on a real board.",
  "columns": [
    "WHO USES IT",
    "THE TESTER",
    "WHAT IT TALKS TO"
  ],
